<p class="content_paragraph">
  You are given the heads of two sorted linked lists
  <code class="content_code">list1</code>
  and
  <code class="content_code">list2</code>
  .
</p>
<p class="content_paragraph">
  Merge the two lists into one
  <strong class="content_bold">sorted</strong>
  list. The list should be made by splicing together the nodes of the first two
  lists.
</p>
<p class="content_paragraph">
  Return
  <em class="content_italic">the head of the merged linked list</em>
  .
</p>
